Video Summary
This video introduces Spec Kit, an open-source toolkit by GitHub that implements Spec-Driven Development (SDD). The tool aims to fix common issues with AI coding (often called "vibe coding") by providing a structured, verifiable workflow. It guides developers through four distinct phases: Specify, Plan, Tasks, and Implement, ensuring that AI coding agents have clear instructions and constraints at every step.
